  S~S The Elevator Pitch

------------------------------------------

    This README file is about the template documents, one of which is a template README file.

    This README file is a description of the purpose and content of information IN human metadata.

    Like the Elevator Pitch, the README is the best, and maybe only, chance to sell the software.

